+Utilibre SafeTwitch backend, 2026-10-06
+Upstream: https://codeberg.org/SafeTwitch/safetwitch-backend
+Revision: 91dda1ceb50822cc9b5306f6c1a92f7e8aaf747b
+License: AGPL-3.0; upstream license/notices preserved.
+
+Changes: Go 1.26/current locked dependencies; bounded Twitch/CDN-only HTTPS
+transport with public-IP DNS pinning and redirect checks; response size/deadline
+limits; closed response bodies; MIME checks; generic errors; fixed URL-safe
+playlist encoding; proxy regression tests; gateway-only forwarded-IP trust;
+disabled chat unless explicitly opted into; removed process-global locale race.
+Build: docker build -f Dockerfile.utilibre -t utilibre-safetwitch-backend:91dda1c-p1 .
+Do not set UTILIBRE_CHAT_ENABLED=true without separately reviewing the chat relay.
+Runtime URL=https://twitch.utilibre.org, PORT=7000, GIN_MODE=release.
+No visitor credentials or private upstream accounts are configured.
+Deploy only behind the matching bounded gateway and private-egress firewall:
+https://github.com/mycelibre/utilibre/tree/main/deployment/community
